1. DEFINITIONS

   "Software" means the Sapphics Structure Library mod, including all source
   code, compiled bytecode, binary assets, file formats, and documentation
   distributed under this license.

   "Proprietary Code" means all source code and compiled classes within the
   package com.sapphic.ssl.internal and any sub-packages thereof, including
   obfuscated equivalents.

   "Public API" means the interfaces, classes, and types within the package
   com.sapphic.ssl.api and any sub-packages thereof.

   "Dependent Mod" means any Minecraft mod, plugin, library, or software
   project that calls into the Public API at runtime without reproducing the
   Software's internal implementation.

   "Modpack" means a collection of mods distributed together for use by end
   users.

   "You" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under this
   license.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

2. GRANT OF API USE

   Subject to the terms of this license, Sapphic grants You a worldwide,
   royalty-free, non-exclusive, non-transferable right to:

   (a) Include the unmodified compiled Software (.jar) as a dependency of a
   Dependent Mod;

   (b) Call, implement, and interact with the Public API;

   (c) Distribute Your Dependent Mod to end users.

   This license does not grant ownership of the Software.

