3. MODPACK DISTRIBUTION

   You may include and redistribute the unmodified compiled Software (.jar)
   as part of a Modpack, provided that:

   (a) The Software is not altered in any way;

   (b) All original copyright and attribution notices are retained;

   (c) The Software is not rebranded or misrepresented.

